## User

The sum of a list of natural numbers.

## Type

type
```agda
sumList : List ℕ → ℕ
```

## Term

```agda
sumList [] = 0
sumList (x ∷ xs) = x + sumList xs
```

## agda

-- We can prove the following equalities

+-identityˡ : ∀ (n : ℕ) → 0 + n ≡ n
+-identityˡ n = refl

+-identityʳ : ∀ (n : ℕ) → n + 0 ≡ n
+-identityʳ zero = refl
+-identityʳ (suc n) = cong suc (+-identityʳ n)
```

## agda

+-suc : ∀ (m n : ℕ) → m + suc n ≡ suc (m + n)
+-suc zero n = refl
+-suc (suc m) n = cong suc (+-suc m n)
```

